    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28533" root="عرب" body-key="E">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعرب</span></b> : see 5: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  see also 4, first sentence: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  and the same again in the latter half
of the paragraph. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعرب جَرَبًا</span>, said of a
camel, <i>He was affected with mange,</i> or <i>scab,
which began in his armpits and groins</i> or <i>similar
parts, and his lips, and appeared upon the general
extent of his skin.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعربت</span>, said
of a cow, <i>She desired the bull.</i> (O, K.)

